+ * Function:	EFUSE_ShadowWrite
+ *
+ * Overview:	Write efuse modify map for later update operation to use!!!!!
+ *
+ * Input:       NONE
+ *
+ * Output:      NONE
+ *
+ * Return:      NONE
+ *
+ * Revised History:
