+/*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Function:	efuse_ShadowRead1Byte
+ *			efuse_ShadowRead2Byte
+ *			efuse_ShadowRead4Byte
+ *
+ * Overview:	Read from efuse init map by one/two/four bytes !!!!!
+ *
+ * Input:       NONE
+ *
+ * Output:      NONE
+ *
+ * Return:      NONE
+ *
+ * Revised History:
+ * When			Who		Remark
+ * 11/12/2008	MHC		Create Version 0.
